**The bug** (`src/sim.ts:43`): `if (foodSurplus >= 0)` grew population when the surplus was zero — i.e. when production exactly equaled consumption. Changed to `if (foodSurplus > 0)` so population only grows on a genuine surplus, matching the docstring ("grows by 1 if there was a food surplus").

